    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31617" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏbēsĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		obesus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fatness, stoutness, corpulence, obesity</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et obesitas ventris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Dom. 18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Claud. 41</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 6,
			24</span></i>.—Of trees: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(arbores) laborant obesitate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 24, 37, § 219</span></i>
			.</div>
